  CustomerActor, CustomerFeatureState, CustomerFrequentProduct, CustomerMapMarker, CustomerOpportunity, CustomerVisit,
  CustomerVisitPlan, CustomerVisitRoute, EntityId, FrequentProductDraft, OpportunityDraft, OpportunityStage,
  PageResult, PublicSeaEntry, PublicSeaRule, PublicSeaRuleDraft, RouteDraft, VisitDraft, VisitPlanDraft, MembershipLevel, MembershipLevelDraft, CustomerMembership, PointAccount, PointLedgerEntry, PointsSettings, PointsSettingsDraft, PointAdjustmentType,
  CouponTemplate, CouponTemplateDraft, CouponInstance, Promotion, PromotionDraft, PromotionRule, VoucherCampaign, VoucherCampaignDraft, VoucherIssue, MarketingArticle, MarketingArticleDraft, MarketingAnalysisResult, MarketingStatus,
  CustomerChannelState, WecomSyncSettings, WecomSyncRecord, WecomBroadcast, WecomTagMapping, WecomScript, WecomWelcomeMessage, WecomGroup, WecomMoment, MallCustomerAccount, MallEmployeeAccount, MallDesign, MallExtension, MallAd, MallPopup, MallMessage, MallSettings,
